WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Standing heavy punch hits Ryu near the corner.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.350
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.400
OD Flash Knuckle relaunches Ryu.

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.600
Medium Rising Uppercut catches Ryu first.

5
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.800
A second, light Rising Uppercut continues the juggle.

6
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.700
Luke lands as Ryu recovers at the corner.
